(6965457, 1050167, 104230, '<td valign="top">A very creative response to the challenge. I like the processing and details such as the broken vase, with the white lines echoing the white frame of the photo, and the texture of the surface below the vase. However, to my eyes there is something awkward about the placement of the photo element.  It "cramps" the flower in the vase, which may be intentional and may have symbolic value that I am missing.  I wonder how it would look with the old rose placed partially in front of the inserted photo? ... just a thought.  But I still like this image a lot and it caused me to stop and want to understand it. Thank you.</td>', 'A very creative response to the challenge. I like the processing and details such as the broken vase, with the white lines echoing the white frame of the photo, and the texture of the surface below the vase. However, to my eyes there is something awkward about the placement of the photo element.  It "cramps" the flower in the vase, which may be intentional and may have symbolic value that I am missing.  I wonder how it would look with the old rose placed partially in front of the inserted photo? ... just a thought.  But I still like this image a lot and it caused me to stop and want to understand it. Thank you.', '2013-01-27 14:51:03.000000', NULL, 1),
