(6965662, 1050250, 69325, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by colorcarnival:</b></div><hr/><i>Please, please, please... for the love of chocolate... show me where in the rules it says that I have committed a DQ-able offense. Actually, when you find it, I challenge you to post the rule here and in the forums. And if something is found and it gets DQ''d... c''est la vie. No big deal. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Well, I didn''t mean any offense, I am just assuming that since the nature of challenges are anonymous that having a shot in there with a watermark of your name would be a problem. Although I guess anyone could have used your shot so maybe youre right. I also wondered if it fell under the adding of text rule somehow....At any rate I never voted, but I wouldnt have dinged you if i did :)</td>', 'Originally posted by colorcarnival:Please, please, please... for the love of chocolate... show me where in the rules it says that I have committed a DQ-able offense. Actually, when you find it, I challenge you to post the rule here and in the forums. And if something is found and it gets DQ''d... c''est la vie. No big deal.   Well, I didn''t mean any offense, I am just assuming that since the nature of challenges are anonymous that having a shot in there with a watermark of your name would be a problem. Although I guess anyone could have used your shot so maybe youre right. I also wondered if it fell under the adding of text rule somehow....At any rate I never voted, but I wouldnt have dinged you if i did :)', '2013-01-28 00:39:29.000000', NULL, 0),
