(6965682, 1050250, 67697, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by smardaz:</b></div><hr/><i> Well, I didn''t mean any offense, I am just assuming that since the nature of challenges are anonymous that having a shot in there with a watermark of your name would be a problem. Although I guess anyone could have used your shot so maybe youre right. I also wondered if it fell under the adding of text rule somehow....At any rate I never voted, but I wouldnt have dinged you if i did :) </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Not offended at all.  Just irritated by the general consensus that this might be DQ-able and then no one submits a validation request. (Probably because DPC is full of a lot of nice people.)<br/> <br/>Also, I''m now bumming that the strongest point of this image was my watermark :) lol.</td>', 'Originally posted by smardaz: Well, I didn''t mean any offense, I am just assuming that since the nature of challenges are anonymous that having a shot in there with a watermark of your name would be a problem. Although I guess anyone could have used your shot so maybe youre right. I also wondered if it fell under the adding of text rule somehow....At any rate I never voted, but I wouldnt have dinged you if i did :)   Not offended at all.  Just irritated by the general consensus that this might be DQ-able and then no one submits a validation request. (Probably because DPC is full of a lot of nice people.) Also, I''m now bumming that the strongest point of this image was my watermark :) lol.', '2013-01-28 01:35:35.000000', NULL, 0),
